  cites Diagram chapter DiagramModel
  cites Diagram chapter DiagramSerializer

 Persistent storage for diagrams. Writes the full diagram JSON
 to the DiskFacts log as a multi-sector fact with app kind 22.

Section: Constants

  persist-kind-diagram : Integer = 22

Section: Save and Load

  diagram-persist-save : DiskFactStore, Diagram, Integer -> DiskFactStore
  diagram-persist-save (store) (dg) (timestamp) =
    let json = diagram-to-json dg
    in app-write-and-checkpoint store persist-kind-diagram json timestamp

  diagram-persist-load : DiskFactStore -> Maybe Diagram
  diagram-persist-load (store) =
    let found = app-scan-last store persist-kind-diagram
    in when found
      is Nothing -> Nothing
      is Just (json) -> diagram-from-json json
